{
  "info": {
    "name": "Plataforma MOOC - Persona 2 (Identidad y Administracion)",
    "description": "Coleccion funcional para probar el modulo de Persona 2: identidad, sesiones, roles, administracion de usuarios, revocacion de sesiones, recuperacion de contrasena y auditoria.\n\nUso recomendado:\n1. Levanta infraestructura y API.\n2. Importa esta coleccion en Postman.\n3. Ejecuta las carpetas EN ORDEN con Collection Runner: 0 -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4.\n4. La coleccion usa correos unicos con {{$timestamp}} para profesor/estudiante/admin secundario, por lo que puede correrse varias veces. El bootstrap del primer admin tolera 201 o 409.\n5. El flujo de recuperacion de contrasena usa la API HTTP de Mailpit para leer el ultimo correo de recuperacion y extraer el token.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "health_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080/health", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "mailpit_url", "value": "http://localhost:8025", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_email", "value": "admin@example.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_password", "value": "claveSegura123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin2_email", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin2_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacher_email", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacher_password", "value": "claveSegura123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacher_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacher_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "student_email", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "student_password", "value": "claveSegura123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "student_new_password", "value": "nuevaClave123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "student_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "student_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
